Leading QSR Food-Tech with 180+ tech employees and 5500 cr + revenue

\textbf{Software Engineer} \textbf{July 2022 -- Present}

\textbf{Loyalty Rewards Service}\\
\emph{•} Developed a loyalty service that included streak-based rewards,
