customer engagement and boosting repeat business by 35\%..

\emph{•} Designed an LDAP-integrated admin panel for loyalty service,
allowing team to effortlessly view details of 200,000+ users, manage
over 10,000 daily earn/burn transactions, create custom loyalty rules,
reducing manual processes by 40\%..

\textbf{Data Call Service}\\
\emph{•} Created a Data Call service enabling customers to connect with
