costs by 60\% and saving 1.3 crore annually.

\emph{•} Optimized real-time latency and reliability by implementing
adaptive bitrate streaming and fallback mechanisms for low-network
scenarios.

\textbf{Delivery Management System}\\
\emph{•} Created a rider incentive calculation service tailored to
diverse scenarios and store-specific criteria, improving Rider payment
accuracy by 45\% and ensuring fair compensation.

\emph{•} Implemented a circuit breaker pattern to enhance the resilience
