calls to each service.

\emph{•} Developers only need to register their service on the SSO
platform, plug in the library, and enable secure communication across
backend services without the need for manual SSO integration. This
streamlined approach cut down

implementation time by 80\%.

\textbf{Unified Payment Service}\\
